## Notes
- MCU message types observed:
  - 00020001: Unknown (possibly scan related)
  - 00020002: Unknown (possibly state change)
  - 00020003: Unknown (possibly config)
- Status 30 = ASSOC_DENIED_TEMPORARILY (comeback mechanism)
- Reason 6 = CLASS2_FRAME_FROM_NONAUTH_STA (AP rejected unauth frame)
- The patches allow the driver to recover from MCU timeouts without crashing
